{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120745","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120745/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120745/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120745/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120745","id":4771417150,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHGYMPg","number":120745,"title":"Lightmap Baking Artifacts when using Static Directional Light with Materials that have Distance Fade enabled","user":{"login":"Wenedi-Git","id":105872847,"node_id":"U_kgDOBk99zw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105872847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenedi-Git","html_url":"https://github.com/Wenedi-Git","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenedi-Git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenedi-Git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenedi-Git/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenedi-Git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenedi-Git/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenedi-Git/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenedi-Git/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenedi-Git/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenedi-Git/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-06-29T20:36:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T22:39:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.7\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9649) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-9900KF CPU @ 3.60GHz (16 threads) - 31.93 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen baking lightmaps with static lights and materials with distance fade enabled, strange artifacts appear on the objects.\n\nDistance Fade is a setting in material properties:\n<img width=\"375\" height=\"1179\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7b9b2e51-140b-46cf-b1c0-b2641a1c46a8\" />\n\nLightmap Bake with Distance Fade **disabled** and a static directional light:\n<img width=\"1768\" height=\"1222\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1931f091-70fb-4255-a531-70a378357ff2\" />\n\nLightmap Bake with Distance Fade **enabled** and a static directional light:\n<img width=\"1767\" height=\"1216\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a350e5d7-0770-4b7d-956d-4a1d8fbeedb9\" />\n\nThe Fade distance seems to have an effect on the severity of this issue.\n\nLightmap Bake with Distance Fade **enabled** and Max Distance set to 5m (Distance Fade Settings) + a static directional light:\n<img width=\"1768\" height=\"1212\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/95c9d671-ac63-4ec4-9dd4-9795cb304a18\" />\n\nMax Distance Changed to 1m:\n<img width=\"1766\" height=\"1212\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1694eada-163a-42bc-81f6-437c7586acf3\" />\n\nIt seems all lightsources are affected by this, but it's the most visible with directional lights.\nAll Distance Fade modes are affected by this issue.\nLarger Fade Distances cause more artifacts.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nBake Lightmaps on a level that:\n\n1. uses objects with a material which has the Distance Fade option **enabled**.\n2. uses a static directional light (or any light, but its easiest to see on directional)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[LightmapBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29480494/LightmapBug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120745/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120745/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}